<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-STOCKHOLM OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STOCKHOLM OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockholm Open semifinal results</p>
<p>on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Todd Martin (U.S.) beat Magnus Norman (Sweden) 6-3 3-0</p>
<p>(Norman retired with an ankle injury)</p>
<p>3-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 6-3</p>
<p>3-6 6-3.</p>
</text>
